sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Operator
  participant G as Safety gate
  participant V as Drift verifier
  participant R as Renderer
  participant D as Owned output directory
  O->>G: Request validation
  G->>G: Reject destructive commands
  G->>V: Permit fixed read-only commands
  V-->>O: Coverage and drift result
  O->>R: Render after a clean check
  R->>G: Resolve destination path
  G->>D: Permit repository-owned write
  D-->>O: Updated artifact
